<item>
            <title>[ZEPPELIN-2091] New paragraph is appeared in &quot;Link this paragraph&quot; window.</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-2091</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;I faced the following issue like screenshot in new window which is created by &quot;Link this paragraph&quot;.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Here is the test way.&lt;br/&gt;
1. click &quot;Link this paragraph&quot; of a original paragraph menu.&lt;br/&gt;
2. click &quot;Insert New&quot;.&lt;br/&gt;
3. check the window made in &quot;Link this paragraph&quot;. &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;This paragraph is appeared in &quot;Link this paragraph&quot; window.&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
