    1. click &quot;Link this paragraph&quot; of a paragraph menu.&lt;br/&gt;
    2. click `Insert New` or `remove`.&lt;br/&gt;
    3. check the window made by &quot;Link this paragraph&quot;. &lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;/ol&gt;
		&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;/ol&gt;
	&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;


&lt;ol&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;
	&lt;ol&gt;
