	&lt;/ol&gt;
	&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;When clicking `Insert New` in a paragraph menu, it appears new paragraph in the window of `Link this paragraph`.&lt;br/&gt;
    !&lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;z_2091_b&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;a href=&quot;https://cloud.githubusercontent.com/assets/8110458/22874942/29993076-f20c-11e6-827f-01afe1189744.gif&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://cloud.githubusercontent.com/assets/8110458/22874942/29993076-f20c-11e6-827f-01afe1189744.gif&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;When click `remove` in a paragraph menu, the window of `Link this paragraph` appears empty screen.&lt;br/&gt;
    !&lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;z_2091_b_remove&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;a href=&quot;https://cloud.githubusercontent.com/assets/8110458/22874973/5fcab71e-f20c-11e6-9415-22f3fe84456e.png&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://cloud.githubusercontent.com/assets/8110458/22874973/5fcab71e-f20c-11e6-9415-22f3fe84456e.png&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;



&lt;p&gt;    [ After ]&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;It doesn&apos;t work in the window of &apos;Link this paragraph`&lt;br/&gt;
