&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;_Note that text and title shape of the paragraph in window is covering &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/zeppelin/pull/1983._&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/zeppelin/pull/1983._&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
